    <string name="player_whisper_label">AI Subtitles (Whisper)</string>
    <string name="player_whisper_desc">When enabled, audio is sent to nexstream.uk for on-device speech recognition. Disable to prevent any audio leaving this device.</string>
    <string name="player_whisper_autostart_label">Automatically start on Live TV</string>
    <string name="player_whisper_autostart_desc">Starts AI subtitles automatically when you open a live TV channel. Off by default — you can always enable them manually using the CC button.</string>
    <string name="player_auto_lang_label">Auto-detect non-English audio</string>
    <string name="player_auto_lang_desc">On Live TV, if the selected audio track is in a language other than English, you\'ll be asked if you want to add subtitles.</string>
